#. <CLT 4>ボクが…一番乗りみたいだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I'm the first one this time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 早いのね、苗木君…
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You're early, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. …心の準備は出来てるみたいね？
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Does that mean you feel prepared?"
msgstr ""

#. うん…一応はね…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah...for now, at least."
msgstr ""

#. でも、他のみんなは？
#. まだ来てないみたいだけど…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But where's everyone else? Why aren't they here yet?"
msgstr ""

#. 心配しなくても、すぐに来るわ…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Don't worry, I'm sure they'll be here soon."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言った霧切さんの言葉通りだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just like she said...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …十神クン！
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Byakuya!"
msgstr "Byakuya!"

#. ………………
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 十神…クン？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-Byakuya...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが言った通り、
#. みんなは続々とホールに集まってきた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They arrived, one after another.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…そんな彼らの様子は揃いも揃って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But they were all in the same state of shock.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 朝日奈さん…？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hina...?"
msgstr "Hina...?"

#. ………………
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 葉隠…クン…？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hiro?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>無言…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Silence.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それも、ただの無言じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And it wasn't any normal silence.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>互いが互いを疑ってるような…
#. まるで、それは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was the deafening silence of fear and suspicion. It\n"
"was like...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園生活が始まった当初のような雰囲気…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the first class trial.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おっくれましたーーーーッ！！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "AaaahhhI'mlaaaattteeee!!!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. いやん、無口な白夜様も素敵だわ！
#. クールでホットで萌えるわね！！
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ahh, strong silent Master is so wonderful! So cool, so\n"
"hot, my loins are ablaze!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、心配しないで！
#. アタシに任せとけば問題ねーから！
msgctxt "0027 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Now listen, everything'll be just fine if you leave it\n"
"to me!"
msgstr ""

#. 念入りにハサミも手入れしてきたし、
#. これで、悪の親玉をサクっとエグりゃ…
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"With my scissor-sharp scissors in hand, I'll stab and\n"
"gouge and shiv the master of evil...!"
msgstr ""

#. …って言うか、
#. 萌える男子以外は…殺さないんじゃ…？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But, I thought you couldn't kill anyone but adorable\n"
"little boys..."
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様の為なら、男でも女でも関係ねぇっす！
#. だから、アタシに任せ…
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If it's what Master wants, it can be boy, girl, or\n"
"anything in between! I can handle it..."
msgstr ""

#. …へックシ！！
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...Achoo!"
msgstr ""

#. う…うぅ…
#. ここは…どこ…？
msgctxt "0032 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "N...nng...where a-am I?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 残念過ぎて、言葉が見当たらないわね…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No human language can describe the disappointment I'm\n"
"feeling right now."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…揃ってる揃ってる…
#. シケた顔が揃ってやがるよ…
msgctxt "0035 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu. Is everyone here? Ooh, and wearing our Gloomy\n"
"Gus faces, I see!"
msgstr ""

#. さてと、じゃあ始めましょうか！
msgctxt "0036 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Okay, well then...let's begin!"
msgstr ""

#. 真っ黒な絶望に塗りつぶされた最後の学級裁判！
#. これぞ、暗いマックス！
msgctxt "0037 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This final class trial is gonna be slathered in\n"
"pitch-black despair! Climaximum sorrow!"
msgstr ""

#. …そうね。今度こそ公平な学級裁判をね。
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You're right. This *is* the final class trial. And\n"
"this time, it'll be fair."
msgstr ""

#. “今度こそ”なんて、クマ聞き悪いなぁ！！
msgctxt "0039 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Whaddya mean, THIS time!? Stop with all the slander!\n"
"I'm a bear in good standing, ya know!"
msgstr ""

#. “世界公平なヤツ選手権”があれば、
#. ボクはグランドチャンピオン間違いなしの逸材だよ！？
msgctxt "0040 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If there was a Mr. Fair Guy Universe contest, I'd take\n"
"home the tiara every year!"
msgstr ""

#. 正々堂々と勝負して勝ってやるって！
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm gonna win this game super fair and square!"
msgstr ""

#. そんで…テレビの前のみんなにも
#. わからしてやるんだよ…
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And I'll make sure everyone watching at home knows..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“絶望”<CLT>は<CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>よりも強しってね…
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...that <CLT 3>despair<CLT> is mightier den de <CLT 3>hope<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ごたくはいい。さっさと始めるぞ。
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Enough of your tedious drivel. Begin the trial\n"
"already."
msgstr ""

#. そうっすね。
#. じゃあ、さっさと始めましょうか。
msgctxt "0045 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Sure, sure. Let's begin the trial already!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ボクは下で待ってるから…
msgctxt "0046 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'll be waiting for you down below."
msgstr ""

#. …逃げんなよ。
msgctxt "0047 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So don't try and run away..."
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0048 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahh-hahahaha!"
msgstr "Ahh-hahahaha!"

#. <CLT 4>いつも通りの高笑いを残し、
#. モノクマはボクらの前から姿を消した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Laughing as loud as ever, Monokuma disappeared.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ふん、いいだろう。
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmph. Whatever."
msgstr ""

#. すぐに…終わらせてやる…
msgctxt "0051 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "This will be over in no time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、十神クンは真っ先に
#. エレベーターに乗り込んでいった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With an inexplicable confidence, Byakuya was the first\n"
"into the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、他のみんなも
#. それに続くように…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One by one the others followed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0054 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0055 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うぅ…ぐぅぅ……
msgctxt "0056 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Gh-ngh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>互いに視線を合わせる事なく、
#. 無言のまま、エレベーターの中へと消えていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nobody made eye contact, nobody said a word. They just\n"
"disappeared into the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何か…みんなの様子が変ね…
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "They're all acting...odd."
msgstr ""

#. まるで疑心暗鬼…
#. お互いを疑い合ってるみたいだわ…
msgctxt "0059 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Like they're paranoid, suspicious of each other..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、あなたはその理由に
#. 気付いているようね？
msgctxt "0060 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But you know why that is, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…多分だけど…
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I think so..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、その話は後で聞かせてもらうわ…
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well, you can tell us all about it soon."
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判でね…
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "At the class trial..."
msgstr ""

#. わかってるよ…
#. もう…覚悟は決まってるから…
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right. I'm ready..."
msgstr ""

#. …勝つ覚悟よね？
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Ready to win, right?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろんだよ…
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Of course..."
msgstr "Dĩ nhiên..."

#. その言葉が聞けて良かったわ…
msgctxt "0067 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm glad to hear you say that."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、霧切さんも
#. エレベーターへと乗り込んでいった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then Kyoko was aboard the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今更、こんな物がなんだって言うんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"dunno why I still say that after all this time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. 今更、こんな物がなんだって言うんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... I dunno why I bother saying\n"
"anything about it anymore...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ボクは歩き出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I started making my way toward the opening.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>エレベーターに向かって、
#. 歩を進めていく。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Step after step toward that gaping maw...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これが最後…自分にそう言い聞かせながら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd resolved that this would be the last time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不思議と恐怖はなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I repeated to myself that there was no fear, no\n"
"mystery left.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>震えや緊張も、どこかに消えていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I pushed the anxiety down, calmed my trembling body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクはしっかりとした足取りで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And finally, on steady legs...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>エレベーターへと乗り込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I passed the threshold and stood in the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>動き出したエレベーターは、
#. ただ真っ直ぐに落ちていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without warning it began to descend...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>深く深く…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Deeper and deeper...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>深く…もっと深く…ずっと深く……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Deeper...deeper...deeper still.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>深く深く…深く深く…深く深く…深く深く…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Deeper and deeper, deeper and deeper, deeper and\n"
"deeper...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>落ちていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Deeper and deeper it fell...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ボクはゆっくりと目を閉じた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I closed my eyes, and sight fell away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やがて音も消える。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All sound, too, disappeared.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そのまま、再び扉が開かれるのを待った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Alone in the universe, I waited for the elevator doors\n"
"to open for the last time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しばらくして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What could have been seconds or centuries later...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>エレベーターが停止する振動を体に感じ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I felt the gentle vibration of the elevator come to\n"
"an end.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、ゆっくりと目を開いた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I slowly opened my eyes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう逃げられないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no running away now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Không thể chạy trốn được nữa rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"
